## 5. 反模式（Anti-patterns）

```vue
<!-- ❌ 根元素不用 StdListContainer，自己写 div 排版 -->
<div class="my-page"><div class="query-area">...</div></div>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ StdListLayout + #pagination 旧写法，应改为 StdListContainer 拼装 + StdListAreaTable 内置分页 -->
<StdListLayout>
  <template #query>...</template>
  <template #table>...</template>
  <template #pagination><el-pagination ... /></template>
</StdListLayout>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ StdListAreaTable 未绑定 list-form / list-total / load-list 三属性 -->
<StdListAreaTable>
  <el-table ... />
</StdListAreaTable>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ el-dialog 上放 v-if（应放在 el-form 上），导致关闭后残留校验 -->
<el-dialog v-if="modalVisible" v-model="modalVisible">...</el-dialog>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ v-if 应在 el-form 上，不在 el-dialog 上 -->
<el-dialog v-model="modalVisible">
  <el-form ref="modalFormRef">...</el-form>
</el-dialog>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 查询区用 el-row/el-col 栅格布局（应改为 flex justify-between + div 包裹） -->
<el-form :model="listForm" :inline="true">
  <el-row :gutter="16"><el-col :span="6">...</el-col></el-row>
</el-form>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 模态框 Footer 用"取消/确定"旧文案 -->
<template #footer>
  <el-button @click="resetModal(); loadList();">取消</el-button>
  <el-button type="primary" @click="submitModal">确定</el-button>
</template>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ StdListAreaAction 基本按钮带图标 -->
<StdListAreaAction>
  <el-button type="primary" :icon="PlusIcon">创建租户</el-button>
  <el-button type="danger" :icon="DeleteIcon">删除</el-button>
</StdListAreaAction>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ el-table 未设置 height="100%" -->
<el-table :data="listData" v-loading="listLoading" border stripe>...</el-table>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 输入框未设置 maxlength + show-word-limit，缺少三位一体校验 -->
<el-input v-model="modalForm.title" placeholder="请输入标题" clearable />
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 图标未 markRaw -->
<el-button :icon="Edit" />
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内声明类型
interface LocalFormType { title: string; }
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内直接调 Api
const data = await NoticeApi.getNoticeList({ pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 });
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内写业务判断
if (mode === 'add') { doSomethingDifferent(); }
```

